        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Theme</strong> Soul-Economy · Ghost-Machines</p><p><em>A spirit bound into an industrial furnace, once. Then the binding failed, or was never quite finished, and something with enough coherence to want things walked out of the wreck instead of staying a tool. A body of contained fire and embers, loosely held in a scavenged husk — no blood to fail, no breath to catch. A Butcher or a Fleshmancer has nothing to work with there; whatever holds an Emberforged together, it isn't organs.</em></p>"
